-- ============================================================
-- WorkTracker — Backfill sampling/sending notes + fix mis-parsed dates
-- "Datum vzorčenja"/"Datum pošiljanja" in the source Excel files are not
-- reliably dates — they also carry handling instructions, crop names,
-- and field-boundary notes. This corrects delovni_nalogi_vzorci rows
-- imported by seed_work_order_import_2026_07.sql:
--   - sampling_date/sending_date are cleared unless the source text is
--     unambiguously a date (previously some were corrupted, e.g. a
--     time-only cell "8:56" had become the timestamp 1899-12-30T08:56Z)
--   - sampling_note/sending_note (new columns) always hold the raw text
-- Run AFTER migration_delovni_nalogi_vzorci_notes.sql
-- ============================================================

